Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pehli baar agent install hone ke baad, ek zaroori step hai — company mapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Agent kholiye, Companies tab kholiye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Aapki Tally mein jitni companies hain, sab dikhengi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Har company ke saathi ek FLOWRA company assign karni hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropdown se select kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Agar aap sirf ek company use karte hain, toh mapping easy hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Multi-company setup mein carefully match kariye — wrong mapping se data mix ho sakta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Mapping dabaaein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho gaya — ab data uss company ke liye sync hoga.
